work/macos-boot-11","page_id":"/docs/network/macos-boot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos-boot#launchdaemons路径下的plist指定的进程启动是否存在一定的先后顺序呢","content":"launchd配置文件总共有五个路径，在系统开启之初，只加载了`/System/Library/LaunchDaemons` 和`/Library/LaunchDaemons`路径下的plist文件，另外三个路径下的plist文件是在用户login之后才进行的。"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-boot-12","page_id":"/docs/network/macos-boot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos-boot#launchdaemons路径下的plist指定的进程启动是否存在一定的先后顺序呢","content":"用户的login是由loginwindow进程完成的，而loginwindow的启动又是由`/System/Library/LaunchDaemons`路径下的com.apple.loginwindow\\.plist指定的。"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-boot-13","page_id":"/docs/network/macos-boot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos-boot#launchdaemons路径下的plist指定的进程启动是否存在一定的先后顺序呢","content":"用户登录之后，launchd才会去加载`/System/Library/LaunchAgents` 和`/Library/LaunchAgents`以及`~/Library/LaunchAgents`路径下的plist文件，从而根据plist文件的具体设置去启动相应的进程。"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/network/macos","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","type":"page","content":"macOS","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","网络与工具"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/network/macos"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-0","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos","content":"开发环境和系统设置。"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-1","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/network/macos#minikube","content":"minikube"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-2","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/network/macos#macos工具集","content":"macos工具集"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-3","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/network/macos#认证应用","content":"认证应用"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-4","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos","content":"> 示例命令请按实际环境替换主机、路径、账号、密码和命名空间。"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/network/minio","page_id":"/docs/network/minio","type":"page","content":"MinIO","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","网络与工