示一组规则权限，权限只会增加(累加权限)，不存在一个资源一开始就有很多权限而通过 RBAC 对其进行减少的操作；Role\n> 可以定义在一个 namespace 中，如果想要跨 namespace 则可以创建 ClusterRole"},"2278":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-924","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#role-and-clusterrole","content":"Role资源清单"},"2279":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-925","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#role-and-clusterrole","content":"ClusterRole资源清单"},"2280":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-926","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#role-and-clusterrole","content":"> ClusterRole 具有与 Role 相同的权限角色控制能力，不同的是 ClusterRole 是集群级别的，ClusterRole 可以用于:\n>\n> * 集群级别的资源控制( 例如 node 访问权限 )\n> * 非资源型 endpoints( 例如 /health 访问 )\n> * 所有命名空间资源控制(例如 pods )"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-927","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#role-and-clusterrole","content":"⚠️ 集群角色不能写命名空间"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-928","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"> RoleBinding and ClusterRoleBinding是什么？\n> RoleBinding可以将角色中定义的权限授予用户或用户组，RoleBinding 包含一组权限列表(subjects)\n> 权限列表中包含有不同形式的待授予权限资源类型(users, groups, or service accounts)；RoleBinding同样包含对被Bind的Role\n> 引用；RoleBinding 适用于某个命名空间内授权，而 ClusterRoleBinding 适用于集群范围内的授权"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-929","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"RoleBinding绑定Role"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-930","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"> 角色通过角色绑定，绑定给用户（user/group/sa）\n> 例如：将 default 命名空间的 pod-reader Role 授予 jane 用户，此后 jane 用户在 default 命名空间中将具有 pod-reader 的权限"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-931","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"RoleBinding绑定ClusterRole"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-932","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"> * 集群角色通过集群角色绑定，绑定给用户（user/group/sa）\n> * 同样可以引用ClusterRole来对当前namespace内用户、用户组或ServiceAccount进行授权，这种操作允许集群管理员在整个集群内定义一些通用的ClusterRole，然后在不同的namespace中使用\n>   `RoleBinding`来引用\n> * 例如：以下 `RoleBinding` 引用了一个 ClusterRole，这个 ClusterRole 具有整个集群内对 secrets 的访问权限；但是其授权用户dave只能访问\n>   development 空间中的 secrets(因为 `RoleBinding` 定义在 development 命名空间)"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-933","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"ClusterRoleBinding绑定ClusterRole"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-934","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"> * 集群角色通过角色绑定，绑定给用户（user/group/sa）。将集群角色权限限制在角色命名空间下\n> * 使用ClusterRoleBinding可以对整个集群中的所有命名空间资源权限进行授权；以下ClusterRoleBinding样例展示了授权manager组内所有用户在全部命名空间中对secrets进行访问"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-935","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#resources子资源","content":"> Kubernetes 集群内一些资源一般以其名称字符串来表示，这些字符串一般会在 API 的 URL 地址中出现；同时某些资源也会包含子资源，例如\n> logs 资源就属于 pods 的子资源，API 中 URL 样例如下"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-936","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#resources子资源","content":"> 例如：如果要在 RBAC 授权模型中控制这些子资源的访问权限，可以通过 / 分隔符来实现，以下是一个定义 pods 子资源 logs 访问权限的\n> Role 定义样例"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-937","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"> 权限主体：user、group、sa\n> 权限主体命名方式\n> RoleBinding 和 ClusterRoleBinding 可以将 Role 绑定到 Subjects；Subjects 可以是 groups、users 或者 service accounts"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-938","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"Subjects 中 Users 使用字符串表示，"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-939","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"它可以是一个普通的名字字符串，如 “alice”；"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-940","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"也可以是 email 格式的邮箱地址，如 “xxx\\@163.com”；"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-941","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"甚至是一组字符串形式的数字 ID 。"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-942","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"但是 Users 的前缀 system: 是系统保留的，集群管理员应该确保普通用户不会使用这个前缀格式"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-943","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"Groups 书写格式与 Users 相同，都为一个字符串，并且没有特定的格式要求；同样 system: 前缀为系统保留"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-944","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#资源限制","content":"参数"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-945","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#资源限制","content":"含义"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-946","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#资源限制","content":"