/system-site-font","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"交付前检查"},"2713":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-10","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","content":"系统参数、站点设置和字体管理属于平台级配置。它们表面上是页面配置，实际会影响登录展示、资源渲染、导出效果和用户识别。"},"2714":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-11","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"入口：系统管理 → 系统参数。"},"2715":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-12","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"系统参数页控制平台级行为。图中每个参数都可能影响登录、查询、导出、分享或后台任务。修改前先记录原值和原因；修改后不能只确认保存成功，还要做一次登录、数据预览、仪表盘打开和导出检查。"},"2716":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"截图中的系统参数页更适合由少数管理员维护，不建议开放给普通分析人员。参数修改属于平台变更，影响范围往往比页面上看到的更大。例如查询超时、导出限制、分享地址、任务配置这类参数，可能同时影响数据源预览、数据集缓存、仪表盘访问和导出中心。"},"2717":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"管理员修改参数时要注意："},"2718":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-15","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"项目"},"2719":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"建议"},"2720":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"修改前"},"2721":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"记录原值和修改原因"},"2722":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-19","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"修改中"},"2723":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-20","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"一次只改必要参数，避免多个问题叠加"},"2724":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"修改后"},"2725":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-22","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"验证登录、数据查询、导出和分享"},"2726":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-23","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"出现异常"},"2727":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-24","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#系统参数","content":"先回滚最近一次修改，再排查日志"},"2728":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-25","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"入口：系统管理 → 站点设置。"},"2729":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-26","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"站点设置页用于调整系统名称、Logo、浏览器标题等品牌信息。公开交付前，管理员应在登录页、工作台、分享页和浏览器标签页分别检查一次，避免只改了后台配置但前台展示仍是旧名称。"},"2730":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-27","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"站点设置常用于公开交付前统一品牌展示。"},"2731":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-28","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"截图里的配置项一般不会影响数据计算，但会影响用户对系统的识别。公开项目尤其要注意名称、Logo 和浏览器标题一致：用户从登录页进入、从浏览器标签切换、从分享链接打开时，看到的应该是同一个产品或项目名称。"},"2732":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-29","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"建议检查："},"2733":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-30","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"登录页名称是否规范。"},"2734":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-31","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"浏览器标题是否符合项目要求。"},"2735":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-32","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"Logo 是否清晰。"},"2736":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-33","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"页面底部或版权信息是否符合企业规范。"},"2737":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"分享页面是否也展示正确。"},"2738":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"入口：系统管理 → 字体管理。"},"2739":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体管理页影响仪表盘、大屏和导出效果。上传字体后，不能说明所有页面会自动使用该字体；需要在对应仪表盘或大屏编辑器中选择并保存。对外项目还要确认字体授权范围。"},"2740":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体管理常用于数据大屏交付。上传字体前应确认授权范围，尤其是对外展示、商用项目和客户交付环境。"},"2741":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体上传后建议用一张正式大屏做验证，而不是只看字体列表是否出现。因为字体真正生效的位置在编辑器和渲染结果中，特别是中文标题、数字指标、导出图片和投屏环境。对外项目要避免使用没有授权的商业字体。"},"2742":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"操作流程："},"2743":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#准备字体","content":"确认字体文件来源、授权范围和格式。"},"2744":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#上传字体","content":"在字体管理页面上传字体文件，名称保持简洁可识别。"},"2745":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#应用到资源","content":"在仪表盘或大屏编辑器中选择字体，保存并预览。"},"2746":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#导出验证","con