志、备份和监控纳入统一管理。首次验证可以使用内置 MySQL，生产环境建议优先评估外部 MySQL。"},"3015":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","content":"集群部署完成后，应通过页面完成业务验证，而不能只依赖 Pod 状态判断。下面的工作台截图可作为第一轮页面验收参考：能登录、能加载菜单、能显示资源统计，说明前端网关、后端服务和元数据库已基本连通。"},"3016":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-22","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#目录结构","content":"`base` 放应用公共配置，包含前端和后端两个 Deployment、两个 Service、PVC、ServiceAccount、后端配置和 Nginx 配置。`internal-mysql` 额外部署 MySQL StatefulSet；`external-mysql` 只部署 Crest，并通过 Secret 连接外部数据库。带 `observability` 后缀的 overlay 会额外部署 Prometheus、Grafana 和相关访问控制。"},"3017":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-23","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"默认应用镜像："},"3018":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-24","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"默认服务："},"3019":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-25","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"服务"},"3020":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-26","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"作用"},"3021":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-27","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"暴露方式"},"3022":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-28","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"`crest`"},"3023":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-29","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":