rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#升级前检查","content":"升级前建议把当前环境状态截图或记录下来：版本号、服务状态、数据库备份文件、当前镜像、配置文件、管理员登录结果和关键页面访问结果。这样升级后出现问题时，可以明确是升级引入还是升级前已存在。"},"4486":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#在测试环境验证","content":"使用生产备份的脱敏副本验证升级，记录耗时、日志和兼容问题。"},"4487":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#冻结生产变更","content":"升级前暂停资源编辑、批量导出、数据集缓存任务和配置变更。"},"4488":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#备份生产环境","content":"备份数据库、配置、运行目录、证书、密钥和当前镜像版本。"},"4489":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#执行升级","content":"替换安装包或镜像，按部署方式执行升级命令。"},"4490":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#观察启动日志","content":"重点关注数据库迁移、连接池、后台任务和错误日志。"},"4491":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#完成功能验证","content":"按上线检查清单验证登录、权限、数据源、数据集、仪表盘、大屏、分享和导出。"},"4492":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"验证通过后通知用户恢复使用，并保留升级观察窗口。"},"4493":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"升级过程中不要同时做无关配置变更。例如不要一边升级版本，一边改域名、SSO、数据库密码、加密模式或权限模型。多个变更叠加会让问题定位变得困难。"},"4494":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"从旧版本升级到 v1.5.10 时，如果不需要国密能力，继续保持 `CREST_CRYPTO_MODE=standard` 即可；用户操作流程不需要调整。如果项目需要启用 `sm-suite`，应先在测试环境验证密钥、登录、数据源、数据集、仪表盘、大屏、分享、导出和 SSO，再安排生产维护窗口。"},"4495":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.10 的升级路径需要按来源版本区分："},"4496":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"来源版本"},"4497":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"升级动作"},"4498":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.8"},"4499":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"备份后替换 `crest-service:v1.5.10` 和 `crest-web:v1.5.10`，不需要执行新增升级 SQL"},"4500":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","content":"v1.5.7"},"4501":{"id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/maintenance/upgrade-rollback#开放用户访问","conten