tent":"数据预览适合做“样例验收”。例如销售类数据要看日期、区域、订单数、金额；研发类数据要看阶段、项目、负责人、需求数和耗时。预览里出现空白、乱码或明显异常值时，先回到数据源或 SQL 处理，不应直接交给图表使用。"},"5355":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-68","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#先认识页面","content":"再切到结构页，检查字段是否被正确识别为维度或指标。字段分类错误会影响后续图表配置效率。"},"5356":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-69","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#先认识页面","content":"结构页决定业务用户如何使用字段。维度通常用于分组和筛选，指标用于求和、平均、计数。字段名应尽量使用业务语言，例如“需求数”“销售额”“负责人”，不建议保留 `req_cnt`、`amt` 这类数据库缩写。"},"5357":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-70","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"Crest 的数据集可以从不同来源创建。首次建模建议先用单表或视图创建；需要统一口径、过滤和关联时，再使用 SQL 或多表建模。"},"5358":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-71","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"创建方式"},"5359":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-72","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"适用场景"},"5360":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-73","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"关键检查"},"5361":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-74","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"数据表/视图"},"5362":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-75","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"数据源里已有整理好的表或视图"},"5363":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-76","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"字段是否完整，数据预览是否正常"},"5364":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-gui