uide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"不写 SQL 的情况下组合多张表"},"5375":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-88","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"关联字段、关联方式和重复数据"},"5376":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-89","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"跨源关联"},"5377":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-90","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"多个数据源之间组合分析"},"5378":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-91","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"性能、字段口径和数据刷新时点"},"5379":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-92","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"能在数据仓库或数据库视图里固化的口径，优先在上游固化；只在 Crest 数据集中处理报表层需要灵活调整的字段、别名、计算和轻量关联。"},"5380":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-93","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"选择方式时，可以按以下顺序判断："},"5381":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-94","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"如果数据库里已经有宽表或视图，优先用“数据表/视图”。这是维护成本较低的方式。"},"5382":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-95","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"如果只需要筛选、改字段名、轻量聚合，可以用“自定义 SQL”。"},"5383":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-96","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"如果数据来自人工台账、目标值或映射表，先创建 Excel/CSV 数据源，再基于它建数据集。"},"5384":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-97","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"如果数据来自接口，先在 API 数据源中把接口配置成 API 表，再基于 API 表建数据集。"},"5385":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-98","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"如果要把事实表和维表组合起来，使用多表关联。确认主表粒度后再关联维表。"},"5386":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-99","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"如果两个来源不在同一个数据源中，才考虑跨源关联；正式页面使用前必须做性能和口径验证。"},"5387":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-100","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#支持哪些创建方式","content":"示例：做“需求流动与交付效率”大屏时，阶段快照适合用数据表或 SQL；人员目标值可能来自 Excel；供应商 SLA 可能来自 API；最终在数据集中整理成“日期、阶段、需求数、负责人、项目、耗时”等字段。"},"5388":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-101","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#基于数据表创建数据集","content":"表模式适合大多数入门场景。只要数据源里有可用表或视图，就可以把它拖入建模区，然后管理字段并保存。"},"5389":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-102","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#基于数据表创建数据集","content":"这张图展示的是数据表模式的新建入口。左侧选数据源和表，中间是建模区，右侧是字段和预览。首次使用时，建议优先拖入一张已经整理好的视图，初始阶段不宜配置复杂多表关联。"},"5390":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-103","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#点击新建数据集","content":"在数据集列表页点击“新建”，选择数据集保存目录。名称建议使用业务语言，例如“日销售趋势”“项目交付明细”“客户活跃统计”。"},"5391":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-104","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#选择数据源","content":"在左侧选择已经测试通过的数据源。看不到数据源时，先检查数据源权限和当前文件夹。"},"5392":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-105","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#选择表或视图","content":"在表列表中找到目标表，将表拖入中间建模区。首次建模优先选择已经整理好的视图，初始阶段不宜拖入大量原始明细表。"},"5393":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-106","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#检查字段分类","content":"日期、地区、部门、产品、客户通常作为维度；金额、数量、时长、比率通常作为指标。字段分类可以调整。"},"5394":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-107","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览数据","content":"点击预览，确认能返回数据。重点检查日期范围、金额单位、空值、重复行和异常值。"},"5395":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-108","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"保存前填写清晰名称，放入正确文件夹。保存后回到详情页检查预览和结构。"},"5396":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-109","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"编辑器中间是建模区，左侧是数据源表，右侧是字段和预览。单表模式下，建模区只需要放一张表或一个视图。"},"5397":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-110","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"编辑器里最重要的是“建模区”和“字段区”。建模区决定数据来源，字段区决定后续图表可使用的字段。保存前要切换到预览，检查真实返回的数据，确认不只是完成了字段拖拽。"},"5398":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-111","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"表模式保存前检查："},"5399":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-112","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"表名或视图名是否选对。"},"5400":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-113","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"字段中文名是否清楚。"},"5401":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-114","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"维度和指标是否分组正确。"},"5402":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-115","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"日期字段是否能按时间排序。"},"5403":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-116","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"金额字段是否含税、是否折扣后、单位是否统一。"},"5404":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-117","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存","content":"预览数据是否能对上业务样例。"},"5405":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-118","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#基于-sql-创建数据集","content":"SQL 模式适合需要先处理数据再交给图表使用的场景，例如合并多个字段、过滤无效记录、做轻量聚合、给字段起业务别名。"},"5406":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-119","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#基于-sql-创建数据集","content":"在编辑器中选择自定义 SQL 后，输入查询语句并运行。SQL 运行成功后，Crest 会根据返回结果识别字段。下图展示的是从表模式切到 SQL 模式后的入口：左侧仍然选择数据源，中间写 SQL，右侧查看字段和预览。"},"5407":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-120","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#基于-sql-创建数据集","content":"入口图展示的是从普通表模式切到 SQL 模式的位置。第一次使用时，先确认左侧选中了正确数据源，再打开 SQL 输入区。SQL 模式仍然依赖数据源权限；如果当前账号看不到数据源，SQL 编辑器也无法读取表。"},"5408":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-121","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#基于-sql-创建数据集","content":"SQL 编辑区不适合堆叠复杂业务逻辑。这里适合做轻量过滤、字段改名、简单聚合和多表查询。正式项目里，复杂且多人复用的口径建议放到数仓视图或公共模型中，数据集 SQL 只保留报表层必要逻辑。"},"5409":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-122","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#基于-sql-创建数据集","content":"这张图适合对照操作：左侧负责选表和查看字段，中间写 SQL，右侧或下方查看运行结果。编写 SQL 时不建议一次写入过多复杂逻辑，可先 `select` 少量字段并 `limit 100`，确认能运行后再补过滤、聚合和别名。"},"5410":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-123","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#基于-sql-创建数据集","content":"SQL 编辑窗口顶部有“运行、参数设置、系统变量、保存”等入口。写完 SQL 后先点运行，确认下方运行结果；需要让 SQL 接收外部条件时，再配置参数。未运行成功的 SQL 不应直接保存，否则后续图表无法获取字段。"},"5411":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-124","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#基于-sql-创建数据集","content":"SQL 创建建议按这个顺序做："},"5412":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-125","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#先写最小查询","content":"只选择要给图表使用的字段，并加上少量行数限制，例如 `limit 100`。确认字段能返回，再继续加工。"},"5413":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-126","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#给字段起业务别名","content":"把 `req_cnt`、`avg_days` 这类技术字段改成“需求数”“平均耗时”。后续业务用户拖字段时更容易理解。"},"5414":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-127","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#加过滤条件","content":"过滤测试数据、无效状态、删除标记或不需要的历史范围。过滤条件要写得能被别人读懂。"},"5415":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-128","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#运行并看结果","content":"点击运行，检查返回列、样例数据和字段类型。运行失败时先修正 SQL，不要保存。"},"5416":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-129","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"保存后回到数据集详情，检查预览和结构页，确认字段分类正确。"},"5417":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-130","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"示例："},"5418":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-131","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"项目交付类示例可以写成："},"5419":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-132","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"这段 SQL 只是示例。真实项目应替换表名、字段名和日期范围；如果数据库不支持 `date_sub` 语法，要按对应数据库改写。重点是让返回字段直接服务图表：日期用于趋势，阶段用于分组，需求数用于统计，平均周期用于时效分析。"},"5420":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-133","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"运行后先查看结果预览，确认字段、类型和示例数据都正确，再保存为数据集。"},"5421":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-134","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"运行结果页要重点看三件事：返回列名是否是业务名称，字段类型是否能被识别，样例数据是否符合预期。字段名和类型确认清楚后，后续图表配置会更顺畅。"},"5422":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-135","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"运行结果验收可以按以下内容检查："},"5423":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-136","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"检查项"},"5424":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-137","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"检查方法"},"5425":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-138","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"不通过时的处理方式"},"5426":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-139","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"字段名"},"5427":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-140","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"是否是“统计日期、项目、需求数”这类业务名称"},"5428":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-141","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"在 SQL 中补别名"},"5429":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-142","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","