user-guide/dataset-345","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"配置定时任务后，必须做两次检查：第一次看任务是否能按设置执行；第二次在下一个周期后回看缓存时间和页面数据是否更新。配置保存成功并不能证明任务长期稳定。"},"5633":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-346","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"示例：项目周会每天上午 9 点查看交付大屏，可以把缓存定时设置在每天 8:30，前提是上游数仓在 8:00 前完成更新。如果上游 9:30 才更新，Crest 8:30 只能同步到旧数据，页面可展示但指标口径不准确。"},"5634":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-347","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"定时配置建议写进数据集说明："},"5635":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-348","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"信息"},"5636":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-349","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"示例"},"5637":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-350","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"刷新方式"},"5638":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-351","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"增量更新"},"5639":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-352","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"增量字段"},"5640":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-353","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"更新时间"},"5641":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-354","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"定时频率"},"5642":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-355","page