-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"数据库名"},"5810":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-113","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"要读取的库名"},"5811":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-114","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"填成实例名、Schema 名或业务系统名称"},"5812":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-115","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"用户名/密码"},"5813":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-116","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"只读账号优先"},"5814":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-117","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"使用个人账号，密码轮换后影响所有报表"},"5815":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-118","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"额外参数"},"5816":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-119","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"JDBC 或连接参数"},"5817":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-120","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#保存并检查","content":"参数拼写错误导致连接失败"},"5818":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-121","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"Excel/CSV 适合补充小规模数据，例如预算表、目标值、门店映射、临时口径表。它不适合承载大规模明细数据，也不适合作为长期多人维护的核心数据源。"},"5819":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-122","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"Excel 表单用于把一个文件变成可建模的数据源。上传前要先处理文件结构：第一行是字段名，下面每一行是数据，不要有合并单元格、说明行、空白列和人工汇总行。截图中的“上传文件”和字段识别区域，是后续数据集能否正常创建的关键。"},"5820":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-123","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"示例：要把“季度目标表”放进 Crest，可以把文件整理成下面这种结构："},"5821":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-124","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"月份"},"5822":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-125","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"部门"},"5823":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-126","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"目标需求数"},"5824":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-127","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"目标交付率"},"5825":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-128","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"2026-05"},"5826":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-129","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"平台研发部"},"5827":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-130","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"120"},"5828":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-131","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-excelcsv-数据源","content":"0.