reen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"6688":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-95","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","content":"数据大屏用于会议室、展厅、值班中心、运营监控和项目展示。和仪表盘相比，大屏属于固定尺寸可视化画布：先确定画布比例，再把标题、指标、图表、表格、说明和装饰按层级排好，最后用全屏方式展示。"},"6689":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-96","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","content":"入口：顶部菜单选择“数据大屏”。"},"6690":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-97","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","content":"列表页用于管理所有大屏资源。新建前先选目录；编辑前先确认是否为正式页面；参考内置示例时，可以先打开预览，再复制到自己的目录中修改。正式项目不应直接修改示例原件，避免后续无法对照。"},"6691":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-98","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","content":"本章截图和字段名来自 Crest 内置演示数据，用来说明创建方法。实际项目中应替换为自己的数据集、字段、指标口径、页面标题和配色。示例不是固定模板，也不是唯一做法。"},"6692":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-99","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"列表页是所有大屏的管理入口。日常使用时，先在左侧选择文件夹，再在右侧打开预览、编辑、复制、移动或删除。"},"6693":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-100","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"区域"},"6694":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-101","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"作用"},"6695":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-102","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"使用建议"},"6696":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-103","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先认识列表页","content":"左侧资源树"},"6697":{"id":"/docs/crest/user