步调整样式","content":"数据正确后，再做样式。大屏样式的目标是“远距离可读”，而非开启所有视觉效果。"},"7008":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-415","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"编辑器截图适合对照右侧样式面板。选中不同组件，右侧配置项会变化。调整样式时先统一标题、字号和单位，再处理颜色、边框、背景和动画。"},"7009":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-416","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"选中组件后，右侧会显示该组件的配置项。先调整位置、尺寸和层级，再调数据和样式。大屏制作中不要频繁手工拖出不同尺寸，建议同一行组件保持相同高度，相邻组件保持一致间距。"},"7010":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-417","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"样式调整顺序："},"7011":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-418","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"标题：先统一大屏标题、图表标题和指标标题的字号。"},"7012":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-419","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"数字：核心指标数字要最大，单位要贴近数字。"},"7013":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-420","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"颜色：同类指标使用同一颜色，异常和风险使用固定警示色。"},"7014":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-421","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"背景：每个组件可以有轻微底色，但背景不能影响文字识别。"},"7015":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-422","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"标签：只显示必要标签，密集图表不宜全开标签。"},"7016":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-423","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"图例：系列多时保留图例，系列少时可以关闭。"},"7017":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-424","page_id":"/docs/crest